      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Over the holidays i listened to new englanders spout off about the #palisadesfire &amp; #eatonfires. All they could speak of was the endangered fish &amp; how water was being used for that &amp; not going to first responders. How stupid newsom is and the “optics.” And this is #mediapropaganda at work b/c if newsom runs this is what they will base voting against him on —a fucking fish. Not a h2o reservoir under repair after a year w/out rain not broken water pipes from the fire heat not 50+mph winds</data>
