    <node id="115856009106807598">
      <data key="d2">@VATVSLPR@c.im: @ai6yr Going after Bass is purely political. I don't think she made a…</data>
      <data key="d3">109467456996781783</data>
      <data key="d4">VATVSLPR@c.im</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-01-07T21:46:44.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@ai6yr Going after Bass is purely political. I don't think she made any mistakes that made a difference in the overall outcome. The big mistake in the #PalisadesFire was leaving a hot spot from a previous fire that could reignite. Once the fire was going, all the fire fighting resources in Southern California weren't going to do much to stop it. Maybe they could have saved more houses, but Pacific Palisades still would have been devastated.</data>
