      <data key="d7">Last year on #ThisDayInHistory, five separate #wildfires broke out in Southern California. Just two of them, the #PalisadesFire &amp; the #EatonFire, damaged or destroyed 18,345 structures &amp; burnt 37,469 acres. Overdevelopment in an arid region &amp; #GlobalWarming are a bad combination.</data>
