      <data key="d2">@TrickTim@mstdn.social: Oh man... I was just getting caught up on #Shrinking on #AppleTV (whi…</data>
      <data key="d3">110897461087270374</data>
      <data key="d4">TrickTim@mstdn.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-01-14T05:15:41.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Oh man... I was just getting caught up on #Shrinking on #AppleTV (which is excellent) and I saw in the cast biographies that Jason Segel was born in Pacific Palisades. 😳 He was a frequent performer at the Palisades Playhouse while in school. It seems that theatre has completely burned down in the #PalisadesWildfire. I feel so bad for all the cultural history lost along with the architecture. Thoughts to all the theatre kids, teachers, and the community who lost a place they loved. #LAStrong</data>
