      <data key="d5">2025-03-28T00:22:51.402Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Via LA County CJIC: It is illegal to raise prices by more than 10% during an emergency. This law extends to rental property and essential goods and services. To file a complaint visit dcba.lacounty.gov or call (800) 593-8222. #EatonFire #PalisadesFire #PriceGouging</data>
