      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I feel bad for these folks in Rustic Canyon... their homes were spared in the Palisades Fire, but now -- depending on rainfall rate and how well drainage and hillside rehabilitation holds -- burn scar flooding risk (IMHO... my opinion only). #PalisadesFire</data>
