      <data key="d5">2025-02-12T23:02:03.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">All these canyons are likely to have some kind of issue now that the hillsides above are burnt, and homes/landscape incinerated. I am not an official or expert on this, but as a disaster watcher these areas would make me nervous. (that said, good chunks of these areas have no one living there now, homes all destroyed) #PacificPalisades #Malibu #PalisadesFire</data>
