      <data key="d4">ai6yr@m.ai6yr.org</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-12T16:10:00.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">5am on Thursday looks to be about when things might get a bit concerning for the #PalisadesFire and #EatonFire burn scars. Wind blowing the storm from the south into Malibu/Pacific Palisades tends to be favorable for orographic enhancement (ie more rain). Check for more details from the local NWS office, if it still exists Thursday 😬</data>
      <data key="d8">palisadesfire|eatonfire</data>
