      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@ai6yr Well-written piece on #Palisadesfire, with some history of the village and how it changed before the fires "My Own Private Palisades: A Writer Remembers His Vanished Neighborhood "A writer who grew up in the devastated community tried — and failed — to save his family home. But he didn’t lose just a house. He lost his childhood." https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/local-news/palisades-wildfire-column-1236120425/</data>
