    <node id="113943443327082552">
      <data key="d2">@exador23@m.ai6yr.org: I've had a hard time getting people to understand. The #EatonFire was…</data>
      <data key="d3">109366550461584397</data>
      <data key="d4">exador23@m.ai6yr.org</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-04T03:15:50.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I've had a hard time getting people to understand. The #EatonFire was NOT a normal wildfire like the #PalisadesFire where vegetation was the bulk of the fuel and homes are just collateral damage because they are tucked in too close to the wilderness. It may have started that way, but then it turned into an urban conflagration where the primary fuel was homes, and the embers from those homes would catch neighboring homes. Much of the suburban vegetation survived. And apparently that fact has fue…</data>
