      <data key="d7">Deadline to submit Right of Entry Forms for free debris removal is March 31, 2025 Residents must chose whether to opt-in or opt-out of the free nonhazardous debris removal program. Those with questions can call the Fire Debris Hotline, or get help completing the form at (844) 347-3332. In-person assistance also is available at the Disaster Recovery Centers open 9 AM to 8 PM. https://recovery.lacounty.gov/debris-removal #PalisadesFire #EatonFire</data>
