      <data key="d7">LA County CJIC: FEMA and the Eaton and Palisades Fires Since the devastation of the Eaton and Palisades fires, FEMA has provided financial assistance to LA County residents who have had damage to their home, personal property, or other disaster-caused emergency needs. If you need help, the deadline to apply for financial assistance is March 10, 2025. To learn more and apply: https://recovery.lacounty.gov/resources #PalisadesFire #EatonFire #FEMA</data>
