      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">So a bunch of trails in the Palisades Fire burn area were burned terribly. A lot of trail maintenance will need to be done due to fire lines, dozer lines, downed trees etc. hopefully starting in February. “ On Saddle Peak Trail, the dozers went through about 20 switchbacks, right down the middle. These will be particularly difficult, and take a great deal of work, to restore.” The Santa Monica Mountains Task Force www.smmtf.org has a nice write up on it. And an attached LA Times article as well…</data>
