    <node id="113885229090141239">
      <data key="d2">@adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com: I've been of a mind to contribute to the relief effort: it makes me f…</data>
      <data key="d3">1156890</data>
      <data key="d4">adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-01-24T20:31:17.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I've been of a mind to contribute to the relief effort: it makes me feel better than wallowing in a depression at my hotel. But I really wonder if I'm just wasting my time...especially since I have no friends, no family, and only a small amount of money. #disaster #wildfires #CaliforniaFires #PalisadesFire #fires #thoughts #self</data>
      <data key="d8">disaster|wildfires|californiafires|palisadesfire|fires|thoughts|self</data>
