    <node id="113885208481149589">
      <data key="d2">@adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com: They literally have done nothing to help me at any stage of the disas…</data>
      <data key="d3">1156890</data>
      <data key="d4">adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-01-24T20:25:58.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">They literally have done nothing to help me at any stage of the disaster. Even when I waited in line for hours to get an "escort" to go back to my house it turned out these illustrious "first responders" were fraudsters: there were no escorts. And there still is no access. #disaster #government #society #wildfires #PalisadesFire #fire #CaliforniaFires #self #thoughts</data>
      <data key="d8">society|wildfires|palisadesfire|fire|californiafires|self|thoughts|disaster|government</data>
