    <node id="113885206093947843">
      <data key="d2">@adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com: You know, online and offline I see so much "thank you, firefighters!"…</data>
      <data key="d3">1156890</data>
      <data key="d4">adamasnemesis@social.adamasnemesis.com</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-01-24T20:25:25.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">You know, online and offline I see so much "thank you, firefighters!". Yeah, thank you? For what!? Nobody lifted a finger to help me or gave a damn about me: up until the moment I witnessed the flames and bugged out I saw not a single "first responder" doing a lick of work. #disaster #government #society #wildfires #PalisadesFire #fire #CaliforniaFires #self #thoughts</data>
      <data key="d8">disaster|government|society|wildfires|palisadesfire|fire|californiafires|self|thoughts</data>
