      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Lots of unidentified bodies still in this list. Dead of smoke inhalation and thermal injuries. So much for the news articles saying "everybody got out" (no, no they did not people...) #EatonFire #PalisadesFire</data>
