    <node id="113875072183144955">
      <data key="d2">@Dj_Miami: This week's Asking Jennifer episode has drawn an urgent question from…</data>
      <data key="d3">113792111972906104</data>
      <data key="d4">Dj_Miami</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-01-23T01:28:25.921Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">This week's Asking Jennifer episode has drawn an urgent question from residents and city leaders: Why was the reservoir empty for nearly a year? The saga traces back to January 2024, when a DWP property manager spotted a tear in the reservoir's floating cover after a series of rainstorms, according to internal emails reviewed by The Times. #la #lacounty #PalisadesFire #pbs #espnu #espn #abc #cbs #foxnews #aon #nbc #southbeach #miamidade</data>
