      <data key="d7">Saturday morning. At the time of my post the #GIS layer with the damage assessment data for #PalisadesFire shows that 6,401 structures have been evaluated. Of those, 3,466 have been designated as destroyed (damage &gt; 50%). Note that some of the evaluated structures are outside of the fire perimeter. #LAfires To search on an address click Menu &gt; Search. Red - Destroyed &gt; 50% Orange - Major 26-50% Yellow - Minor 10-25% Green - Affected 1-9% Black - No damage White - Inaccessible Open GISsurfer map…</data>
