      <data key="d7">@jeridansky Some years ago, I worked in City of Orange (computer programming, support - business program vendor) for a year... Lived in Placentia. Familiar with Santa Ana river bike trail to Huntington Beach. Big Bear - site seeing and concerts up there. Came back to Michigan after that year...</data>
