      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@JohnJBurnsIII @ai6yr If I sold my house now (no plans to do so) I think I'd be required to disclose the encapsulated asbestos, since I know about it. Even if not required, I'd do it anyway, of course. But I sure had no idea when I bought the house, many years ago. I suspected the popcorn ceiling had asbestos (and it did) so I had that removed.</data>
