      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@ai6yr i don't think the mayor could have done much differently to change the course of the Palisades fire, and for someone to place all the blame on her is disingenuous, however, it seems like there's been a bit of corruption in the way her administration has played CYA over the fires. I think that does need to be called out. I'm glad the Times is staying on that.</data>
