      <data key="d5">2025-09-11T03:19:23.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@Finitum @ai6yr I didn't know Riverside had a public utility. LADWP is pretty awesome as far as utilities go. No pre-emptive power outages because they maintain their equipment and do brush clearance. No rolling blackouts because they have a huge pumped hydro facility to store solar and supplement the grid when solar drops off. etc. etc. It makes no sense for necessarily monopolistic ventures to be for-profit.</data>
