      <data key="d7">@ai6yr Photo my sister took on 11:55am on Palisades Dr. as they attempted evac, before evac order at 12:07pm., can see traffic backed up ahead. (they went back home in the Highlands for a few hours, then got out – took them an hour to go 8 miles into Sta. Monica) (their house burned down on the 8th, in the evening we think.) Map shows where picture was taken, about 0.8 miles from intersection of Palisades Dr. &amp; Sunset Blvd.</data>
