      <data key="d7">@ai6yr Its a cool van and all, and it wasn’t perfect. I guess only car people said ‘keep the melted side melted’. Instead of a full restoration leaving the story of its hurt side alone or at least less perfect. I do get wanting it all glam tho. Still cool, but I think showing scars would be cooler. My 2c that wasn’t asked for by anyone lol</data>
