      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@bowlcut @ai6yr many years ago my team (medical education) made a lot of little knitted body parts for med students to try important techniques in a super low pressure environment. We were teaching gynecology procedures, so we had vulvas (very simple, rather geometric ones, not particularly salacious looking). We had to stop handing objects around classrooms at the start of the pandemic (could have been a key route of transmission, we didn't know). So they were retired. My fabulous boss, head o…</data>
