      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@meganL @ai6yr “The FAIR Plan is an insurance pool that all the major private insurers pay into. The plan issues policies to people who can’t get private insurance because their properties are deemed too risky to insure” 🤔</data>
