      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@conejoclint @ai6yr One thing to keep in the back of your mind is that you should make sure that when the car is disposed of that you have the documentation to prove it. I had a car totaled about 10 years ago and had an unexpected tax bill the next year because DMV thought I still owned the car. It was easy enough to fix, but it was an unexpected hassle.</data>
