    <node id="113953845740541498">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: I'm safe at home in #Portland #Oregon. So I can declare the trip to #…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-05T23:21:29.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I'm safe at home in #Portland #Oregon. So I can declare the trip to #Australia a complete success. I had a wonderful time and saw so much more than my previous visit. The hot weather was expected since it's summer there. I got to fly for the first time on an A380 outbound and 787 on the return. And from all the likes and boosts it seems a lot of you appreciated that I shared the experience. #aviation #travel #avgeek</data>
      <data key="d8">portland|oregon|australia|aviation|travel|avgeek</data>
