    <node id="113959156976840548">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: The most dangerous moment in my #Australia trip was due to #weather t…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-06T21:52:09.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">The most dangerous moment in my #Australia trip was due to #weather that could happen anywhere, not due to wildlife🐨🦘🐍. On a walk in a park with lakes in Melbourne, I heard distant thunder &amp; saw sporadic large raindrops. Thunderstorms to the west were moving in. I started back to my friend's place. Almost there, I heard loud buzzing sound from a metal residential fence. I recognized it as St Elmo's Fire, a potential imminent lightning🌩️ strike there. I ran and got indoors. https://en.wikipedia.…</data>
      <data key="d8">australia|weather</data>
      <data key="d9">context_descendants</data>
