    <node id="113959252767386229">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: As much as tourists in #Australia would like to see them, it's hard t…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-06T22:16:33.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">As much as tourists in #Australia would like to see them, it's hard to find a Koala🐨 in the wild. Fortunately @Leighton spotted this one. And I got a picture. This was on Feb 1 at the Tower Hill volcano and surrounding wildlife reserve in southwest Victoria. #travel #photography</data>
      <data key="d8">australia|travel|photography</data>
