    <node id="113959631627502506">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: My #Australia trip started in Sydney. On the way out of town on Janua…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-06T23:52:51.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">My #Australia trip started in Sydney. On the way out of town on January 27, @Leighton and I stopped at a viewing point for #SYD / #YSSY Airport's runways. Pictured here: Singapore 777-300ER, Qantas 787-9 in special Aboriginal art livery, 2 Qantas 737-800NGs, Malaysian A330-300. #aviation #travel #avgeek #photography</data>
