    <node id="114026821282040572">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: 4 weeks ago my adventure to #Australia began. I've been back almost 2…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-18T20:40:04.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">4 weeks ago my adventure to #Australia began. I've been back almost 2 weeks now. It was a fun and memorable trip. I had my first flights on an A380 outbound and 787 on the return trip, both of which can mostly only be found on the longest international flights such as this. I visited New South Wales, Australian Capital Territory, Victoria and South Australia, including Sydney, Canberra and Melbourne. https://avgeek.social/@ikluft/113868608754632970 #aviation #travel #avgeek</data>
      <data key="d8">australia|aviation|travel|avgeek</data>
