    <node id="114038404389523746">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: During my trip to Australia, I switched my devices and apps to show m…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-20T21:45:49.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">During my trip to Australia, I switched my devices and apps to show metric units (Celsius, km, etc). Get the whole experience, right? I don't mind since I can convert most common imperial⇔metric units in my head anyway. That's except for temperature since °F &amp; °C don't have the same zero - I often use a converter app for that. After I returned home, it took almost a week to find all those settings and change them back. 😀</data>
