    <node id="114137074317158961">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: I posted a YouTube video with narrated photos/videos from my trip to…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-10T07:58:55.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I posted a YouTube video with narrated photos/videos from my trip to #Australia in late Jan / early Feb 2025. Thanks to friend &amp; colleague @Leighton for acting as my local guide. Among sightseeing spots: Blue Mountains, Sydney Bridge Climb, Australia Day concert &amp; fireworks in Sydney, Australian Parliament House in Canberra, Melbourne CBD, Great Ocean Road &amp; Naracoorte Caves. Also Portland VIC, since I live in Portland OR. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BZrHoR4Dv8 #aviation #travel #roadtrip…</data>
