    <node id="114159739662898080">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: I'll post another mention of the video I made from my #Australia trip…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-14T08:02:59.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">I'll post another mention of the video I made from my #Australia trip. I noticed once the analytics were collected that YouTube's "algorithm" only promoted it in Australia. 🤦 Though it got 3000 views there. (Yay mates! Thx!) Let's get the word out that the fun pictures people liked earlier in this thread came together into an #avgeek #travel story about lots of fun places to see there. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BZrHoR4Dv8 #aviation</data>
