    <node id="114218721263653989">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: Another sign the seasons are changing... Right now it's the first tim…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-24T18:02:54.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Another sign the seasons are changing... Right now it's the first time since my Jan/Feb Australia trip and some weeks of planning before it that I've seen a higher temperature in Portland, Oregon🇺🇸 than Melbourne, Victoria🇦🇺. In early February when I was sightseeing in Melbourne, the southern hemisphere summer heat was 100F/38C while a lookup showed Portland was just above freezing. Of course it's before sunrise in Melbourne. But Portland's high tomorrow is forecast to be higher. #travel #weath…</data>
      <data key="d8">travel|weather</data>
