    <node id="114231121672118733">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: This was a limited hint of Summer in early Spring. Actually PDX Airpo…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-26T22:36:29.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">This was a limited hint of Summer in early Spring. Actually PDX Airport was reporting 81F/27C and suddenly dropped to 77F/25C. (This is showing a nearby reporting point.) Since yesterday at 80F/26.6C tied the all-time record for any day in March in Portland, we can expect NWS to confirm a new all-time record was set today. As thunderstorms herald an incoming cold front, Melbourne will have warmer temperatures again for at least the next week. But the seasons are changing. #travel #weather</data>
      <data key="d8">travel|weather</data>
