      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-12-18T22:20:47.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Let me add a link at the end of the thread from my January/February 2025 trip to Australia... The deal that fellow #avgeek and #pilot @Leighton and I made was to each act as guide for a #roadtrip visiting the other's country. I did return the favor - here's the link to the thread with pictures from Leighton's trip to the USA in June/July 2025. Each trip was in the other's summer. Neither of us had to drive on the other country's "wrong side of the road". https://avgeek.social/@ikluft/1147397363…</data>
      <data key="d8">avgeek|pilot|roadtrip|aviation|travel</data>
