      <data key="d5">2025-01-24T07:36:52.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@ikluft @MakerAndBakerDesigns Yeah, I watched those last year. 🌠 I went and put my hammock on a friends boat. There's less light pollution on the lake and it's really comfortable. ⛵ I saw dozens of shooting stars, like at least 60 if that's even enough! And some reallly bright ones burning their way through the sky like a cutting torch. I could have seen more but eventually fell asleep! 🤤</data>
      <data key="d8" />
