    <node id="114038563769915092">
      <data key="d2">@simonbp@social.linux.pizza: @ikluft I've got a brain that only thinks about cold temperatures in…</data>
      <data key="d3">109268980483243765</data>
      <data key="d4">simonbp@social.linux.pizza</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-20T22:26:28.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@ikluft I've got a brain that only thinks about cold temperatures in C and hot in F. As a kid in Canada, I never cared how hot it was, just cold I had to dress for. And vice versa after moving to the US. This time of year I find myself flipping units a lot.</data>
