    <node id="114038600167747937">
      <data key="d2">@ikluft@avgeek.social: @simonbp Sounds about right to me. 😀 On the Australia trip, a friend…</data>
      <data key="d3">109525810222134461</data>
      <data key="d4">ikluft@avgeek.social</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-02-20T22:35:39.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@simonbp Sounds about right to me. 😀 On the Australia trip, a friend and I were looking at the forecast for my return home. Even though he's equally good at converting the units, he tripped up and for a moment thought I would have a "100 degree difference" because we just talked about 40°C that day being 104°F, and then of course he thought about freezing as zero (in Celsius).</data>
