      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">@frank @Leighton Right. It definitely wasn't an equal split between the days. I wrote chapter timepoints by days in the video description. The day which earned and got the most time was Day 4 with the Sydney Bridge Climb and Australia Day concert &amp; fireworks show. 2nd place was Day 2 at Blue Mountains National Park and my first visit to Circular Quay for the trip, with an intro about the place.</data>
