      <data key="d7">@ai6yr @rustoleumlove I lost a mentor a few years ago. He was in his 70s and had smoked for decades but stopped in his 60s. He developed emphysema and within 2 years, after a bad summer of wildfire smoke in the sunner, he died that fall. He just could not tolerate anything but pure air. :(</data>
