    <node id="116095783475630547">
      <data key="d2">@ai6yr@m.ai6yr.org: 👀 "Additionally, the lack of the use of standardized communication fo…</data>
      <data key="d3">109321601315889133</data>
      <data key="d4">ai6yr@m.ai6yr.org</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-02-19T06:04:23.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">👀 "Additionally, the lack of the use of standardized communication forms created additional confusion. For example, the documents provided for review for this AAR did not include any ICS 205s (Incident Radio Communications Form) or 205A (Communications List). While the City does not have to use ICS Forms, it would be helpful to have a standardized communications plan that is trained on and regularly updated prior to the next emergency."</data>
