      <data key="d5">2026-02-19T06:15:14.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Ooh, I could see this. Sounds like someone quit in the middle of these fires due to the hours, and not getting overtime or anything. (sucks to be an Exempt employee in a disaster.... at least when you are hourly, it may suck, but you get overtime). I was working contract up until very recently because of this (and still would, for that reason, if it were still available... ah well).</data>
