    <node id="115862104869132956">
      <data key="d2">@patrickokeefe: Southern California is still recovering. The response from Trump - an…</data>
      <data key="d3">109237602809603384</data>
      <data key="d4">patrickokeefe</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-01-08T23:36:58.531Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Southern California is still recovering. The response from Trump - and, by extension, those who support him - has been cruel. After promising to provide the disaster relief funding needed, the vast majority of it has been withheld. The funding has further been conditioned on disenfranchising voters or imaginary water spigots that supposedly could have prevented this tragedy.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">context_descendants</data>
      <data key="d10">1</data>
      <data key="d11">0</data>
      <data key="d12">0</data>
      <data key="d13">1</data>
      <data key="d14">0</data>
      <data key="d15">2</data>
      <data key="d16">1</data>
      <data key="d17">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="115862105355011511">
      <data key="d2">@patrickokeefe: The cruelty deepened, of course, because Trump and his supporters app…</data>
      <data key="d3">109237602809603384</data>
      <data key="d4">patrickokeefe</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-01-08T23:37:05.946Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">The cruelty deepened, of course, because Trump and his supporters apparently saw red in that moment of weakness, and have attempted to deliver blow-after-blow to California in the year that followed. The disaster relief funding was a drop in the bucket of the federal funding that has been withheld from us, or threatened to be withheld, by this administration.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">context_descendants</data>
      <data key="d10">1</data>
      <data key="d11">0</data>
      <data key="d12">0</data>
      <data key="d13">1</data>
      <data key="d14">0</data>
      <data key="d15">2</data>
      <data key="d16">1</data>
      <data key="d17">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="115862105642630533">
      <data key="d2">@patrickokeefe: We shouldn't receive education and research funding unless we scare t…</data>
      <data key="d3">109237602809603384</data>
      <data key="d4">patrickokeefe</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-01-08T23:37:10.336Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">We shouldn't receive education and research funding unless we scare trans people. We shouldn't receive child care funding because of "fraud" that miraculously only exists in states that talk back to Trump. The military should be deployed in our cities unless we scare undocumented immigrants. An estimated 3.4 million Californians (roughly the population of Arkansas) are expected to lose healthcare coverage because of Medicaid cuts. And on and on.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">context_descendants</data>
      <data key="d10">1</data>
      <data key="d11">0</data>
      <data key="d12">0</data>
      <data key="d13">1</data>
      <data key="d14">0</data>
      <data key="d15">2</data>
