      <data key="d17">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="115862105824472189">
      <data key="d2">@patrickokeefe: The message from Trump and his supporters is along the lines of, "in…</data>
      <data key="d3">109237602809603384</data>
      <data key="d4">patrickokeefe</data>
      <data key="d5">2026-01-08T23:37:13.111Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">The message from Trump and his supporters is along the lines of, "in your darkest hour, we'll help you if you become us." But that's not support at all, and it's not American. This era will end - I hope - but the cruelty will not be forgotten.</data>
