    <node id="114240620817226747">
      <data key="d2">@Nonilex@masto.ai: When #marine animals ingest #DomoicAcid, they endure severe neurologi…</data>
      <data key="d3">109303988606874604</data>
      <data key="d4">Nonilex@masto.ai</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-28T14:52:13.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">When #marine animals ingest #DomoicAcid, they endure severe neurological symptoms such as seizures, disorientation, &amp;, ultimately, death. These incidents often necessitate euthanasia due to the high mortality rates associated w/this toxin. This alarming rise in domoic acid poisoning cases not only threatens individual #MarineSpecies but also highlights the broader impacts #humans have on marine #ecosystems. #ClimateCrisis #climate #MarineLife #ocean #wildfires #science #wildlife #MarineMammals</data>
      <data key="d8">marine|domoicacid|marinespecies|humans|ecosystems|climatecrisis|climate|marinelife|ocean|wildfires|science|wildlife|marinemammals</data>
      <data key="d9">context_descendants</data>
