    </node>
    <node id="114240635278552224">
      <data key="d2">@Nonilex@masto.ai: #DomoicAcid can also accumulate in #shellfish &amp; small #fish that feed…</data>
      <data key="d3">109303988606874604</data>
      <data key="d4">Nonilex@masto.ai</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-28T14:55:53.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">#DomoicAcid can also accumulate in #shellfish &amp; small #fish that feed on the #algae, leading to poisoning in larger #marine animals &amp; humans who consume contaminated #seafood. Addressing the urgent need to monitor the impact of harmful #AlgalBlooms on #MarineSpecies requires collective strategies. The destructive #California #wildfires, which have contaminated our #oceans &amp; are threatening #MarineLife, serve as a critical call to action for collaborative efforts to protect marine environments….</data>
      <data key="d8">domoicacid|shellfish|fish|algae|marine|seafood|algalblooms|marinespecies|california|wildfires|oceans|marinelife</data>
