    <node id="114240644516501747">
      <data key="d2">@Nonilex@masto.ai: Recognizing the interconnection of human &amp; #marine #ecosystems is ess…</data>
      <data key="d3">109303988606874604</data>
      <data key="d4">Nonilex@masto.ai</data>
      <data key="d5">2025-03-28T14:58:14.000Z</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Recognizing the interconnection of human &amp; #marine #ecosystems is essential, as the stress in one often affects the other. If you see a marine mammal in distress, please give them space and call the Marine Mammal Care Center’s Marine Mammal Hotline at 1-800-39-WHALE (94253). #ClimateCrisis #climate #MarineLife #ocean #wildfires #science #wildlife #MarineMammals #SeaLions #Dolphins #California</data>
      <data key="d8">marine|ecosystems|climatecrisis|climate|marinelife|ocean|wildfires|science|wildlife|marinemammals|sealions|dolphins|california</data>
